00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:49.480
An accident investigator?

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:51.470
I hope he's a young hunk.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.010
You are so...

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:53.740
What?
You are so...

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.940
Let me introduce you.
This is Eddie Ross.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.080
Him?

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.090
Huh?

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:03.190
Looks like you got your wish.
He's really young.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.280
Ugh...

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.230
Arthur!

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:05.390
Papa.
Arthur!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:06.130
Papa.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.390
