00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:31.720
Hello.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.480
Hello.
Hello.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.590
I'm Eddie Ross.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:40.000
Flight 807 flies between Marshal
and Duke on a weekly schedule.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:45.070
After leaving Marshal, Flight 807
entered the warp terminal in its orbit,

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.060
and then...

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:52.170
...warped approximately thirteen light years,
and emerged from the Duke warp terminal.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:56.030
As you saw in the records,
there was nothing out of the ordinary.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:01.880
Which means they disappeared in the mere 2,000
kilometers between the terminal and the spaceport.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:08.140
Yes. Something happened within
that 1 hour, 51 minute window.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.480
Was there any communication
with them during that time?

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.300
The geomagnetic storm made it impossible.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:13.760
It's so bizarre.
The geomagnetic storm made it impossible.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.860
It's so bizarre.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:18.490
How could 463 people
just vanish like smoke?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.070
I agree.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:24.560
I've been an investigator for over ten years,
but I've never seen anything like this.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.710
Hey, what if they weren't
onboard to begin with?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.180
Maybe they all canceled.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.280
