00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.330
Your daughter?

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:02.670
So your daughter was on Flight 807?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:08.080
Flight 807 wasn't an empty flight when it left.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.960
