was the only thing left behind.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:28.470
Yeah. The other passengers
must have had carry-on luggage, too.

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:31.060
That doll could be a clue.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:32.830
Everything seems normal.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:37.980
We're searching the cabin for a third time,
but it's unlikely we'll find any clues.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.450
I see. Keep searching.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.120
Yes, sir.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:40.350
We're going to fly the same route as Flight 807.
Yes, sir.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.050
We're going to fly the same route as Flight 807.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.690
By doing so, we might find a clue.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.820
I see.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.660
Well then, you do things your way,
and I'll do things mine.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.130
We'll report back in four hours.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.100
I'll be waiting.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.830
He's so level-headed,
even though his daughter is missing.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:02.000
He's a workaholic, just like
the people from a certain country.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.910
I just want to get back to our vacation.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.900
Tell me about it! I want to tan
until I turn completely dark.

