Say, Arthur, why'd you run from us earlier?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.660
B-Because I'd get in
trouble if Papa found out.

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:31.960
Is that all?

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:35.160
Arthur, are you sure you're
not hiding anything?

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.570
I'm not hiding anything.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.400
Really?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.800
Really!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.200
Ahh, that felt great.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.940
There's a kid here! Put some clothes on!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.740
Don't be so uptight.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.340
Hey, boy. Am I gorgeous, or what?

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:52.510
Huh? Not doing it for you?

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.920
Then, I'll give you a special treat.

