00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:14.240
Still, I'm a little worried about that boy.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.270
Why don't we have Mughi look after him?

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.400
Good idea.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.580
