00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.770
It's a ransom note.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:24.870
Then, that means...

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:29.800
It's a kidnapping!

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.920
