00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.650
I-I know that, but...

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:15.010
All I'm saying is that it could
have been an unlikely target.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.420
Have you found anything?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.290
